            </button>
          </h2>
          <div class="details" id="faq-panel-3">
            <p>Boxes provide a sense of security and a perfect vantage point for stalking. Being in a small, enclosed space reduces a cat's stress and helps them regulate their body temperature without much effort.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="example">
          <h2>
            <button type="button" aria-expanded="false" class="faq-trigger" id="faq-trigger-4" aria-controls="faq-panel-4">
